@startuml SD_UC_S4_Theo_Doi_Canh_Bao_Thoi_Gian_Order
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Background Worker" as Worker
participant "KitchenOrderService" as Service
participant "KitchenRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB
control "KitchenHub" as Hub
boundary "Màn hình KDS Bếp" as KdsUI
boundary "Màn hình Trạm Pass" as PassUI

Worker -> Service: Quét kiểm soát SLA (Mỗi 15s)
activate Worker
activate Service

Service -> Repo: GetActiveCookingItems()
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT OrderItemId, MenuItemId, StartedAt, PrepSLA FROM OrderItems WHERE Status = 'Cooking'
activate DB
DB --> Repo: CookingList
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: List<OrderItem>
deactivate Repo

loop Cho từng món đang chế biến
    Service -> Service: CalculateRemainingTime(StartedAt, PrepSLA)
    
    alt Thời gian chế biến vượt ngưỡng (>= 80% SLA hoặc Quá hạn)
        Service -> Hub: BroadcastSlaWarning(OrderItemId, DelayLevel)
        activate Hub
        Hub -> KdsUI: Đổi màu thẻ món (Vàng / Đỏ nhấp nháy)
        Hub -> PassUI: Hiển thị cảnh báo trễ món tại trạm điều phối
        deactivate Hub
    end
end

Service --> Worker: Hoàn tất kiểm soát (Completed)
deactivate Service
deactivate Worker
@enduml

